  "summary": "Daniel Robert Reeder is an American former professional football player who was a running back in the National Football League (NFL). \"Delaware Dan\" Reeder played college football for the Delaware Fightin' Blue Hens and was selected by the Los Angeles Raiders in the fifth round of the 1985 NFL draft. He was cut by the Raiders and signed with the Pittsburgh Steelers. He played parts of the 1986 and 1987 seasons with Pittsburgh, appearing in 13 games. He carried the ball eight times for 28 yards and caught two passes for four yards. He also returned four kickoffs for 52 yards.",
